    "updated_at": "2021-06-29T06:15:49Z",
    "body": "I think I saw the intended behavior when I ran without my config. Without any config for the jobs module, the threshold is 1 and the behavior is the following:\r\n\r\n- 0 jobs -> nothing\r\n- 1 job -> symbol\r\n- 2 jobs or more -> symbol + number\r\n\r\nIt kind of makes sense if you want to use symbol + number, but my use case was that I didn't use any symbol, but rather only a number. Either it's a bug or the documentation should at least reflect that the threshold is for the entire module, and that numbers only show for threshold + 1.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
